'' std/chrono (RFC-0009): LocalDate built and passed to an FB.LocalDate parameter; a static TimeSpan member; the nested namespace WallClock.
'' It is a facade -- exported macros over the header, found through -i as a user's toolchain
'' finds it in its inc/ -- and the program includes that header too, so the facade's names
'' and the header's FB names are shown to be one and the same.
'' TEST: cli
'' ARGS: -target win64-msvc -i toolchains/tiko-windows/inc tests/modules/src/stdfacade/chrono.bas -o tests/modules/stdchrono.exe
'' ENV: TKO_LIBPATH=toolchains/tiko-windows/lib/win64-msvc
'' EXPECT-EXIT: 0
'' RUN: tests/modules/stdchrono.exe
'' EXPECT-RUN-OUT: 2026 9 28 1
'' EXPECT-RUN-OUT: true -1
